          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://jumpserver.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group flex items-center text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">
              <Icon name="carbon:security" class="mr-2 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0" />
              <span>JumpServer 开源堡垒机</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.maxkb.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group flex items-center text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">
              <Icon name="carbon:chat-bot" class="mr-2 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0" />
              <span>MaxKB 开源企业级智能体平台</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
